course: dictionary
lesson: 12127
title: Words that make us smile
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Comical means funny in a silly or odd way, often when the person or thing is not trying to be funny. «The clown tripped over his big shoes and landed on his bottom.» The clown was trying to look serious, but the fall is so silly that it makes people laugh. That is a comical fall.
explain: Look at the words around comical to check its meaning. «Dad wore a comical hat with a giant feather.» The hat is odd and silly, so it makes you smile. Ask yourself: is this funny in a silly way, or just sad or scary? Comical means funny, and it is often silly.
explain: Comical can also mean so badly done that it is almost a joke. «Their plan to paint the fence was comical: they got more paint on themselves than on the fence.» Here the plan is not just silly, it is so badly done that it is almost a joke. Try swapping in silly or funny and see if the sentence still makes sense.
fact: Comical means funny in a silly or odd way.
fact: Something comical often makes people laugh without meaning to.
fact: Comical can also mean so badly done that it is almost a joke.
fact: You can say a sight looks comical, or describe a comical mistake.
fact: Other words for funny are amusing and silly, but comical often suggests something odd as well.
exercise: «The clown's comical fall made everyone laugh.» What does comical mean here? | Sad and lonely | *Funny in a silly way | Dangerous | Very fast
exercise: Find the word that tells you the hat was funny: «Dad wore a comical hat with a giant feather.» | hat | *comical | giant | feather
exercise: «Their plan to paint the fence was comical: they got more paint on themselves than on the fence.» What does comical suggest? | Very expensive | *Silly and badly done, almost a joke | Tidy and neat | Sleepy
test: «The puppy looked comical with a sock on its head.» Why does the puppy look comical? | *Because it looks silly and funny without trying to be | Because it is very big | Because it is very sad | Because it is asleep
test: Which word is closest in meaning to comical when it means funny? | heavy | sorrowful | quiet | *amusing
exam: Which phrase means a sight that makes people laugh without trying? | a dark night | a quiet room | *a comical sight | a sad goodbye
